---
title: "Krewire Release — Official Release Launch & Community Hub"
description: "The official version release launchpad, codebase matrix, and roadmap for the Krewire open-source ecosystem."
layout: Landing
---

<div class="contributors-portal release-portal">

  <!-- HERO -->
  <section class="hero" id="overview">
    <div class="hero-inner">
      <div class="hero-copy">
        <div class="eyebrow" data-i18n="hero.eyebrow">◈ ECOSYSTEM VERSION RELEASE · v0.1.0 GENERAL AVAILABILITY</div>
        <h1 data-i18n-html="hero.title_html">Krewire v0.1.0 is Here.<br>The Modular Go Ecosystem for 8 Workloads.</h1>
        <p class="lead" data-i18n="hero.lead">The official release launchpad for the Krewire open-source ecosystem. A unified, modular Go foundation engineered with single monorepo architecture, one declarative config (krewire.yaml), and one developer CLI (kiw) — crafted in Indonesia for software engineers and autonomous AI agents worldwide.</p>
        <div class="ctas flex flex-wrap gap-3">
          <Button Variant="primary" Size="lg" Href="#releases" DataI18n="hero.cta_release">Explore v0.1.0 Highlights →</Button>
          <Button Variant="outline" Size="lg" Href="#quickstart" DataI18n="hero.cta_quickstart">Install CLI (kiw)</Button>
          <Button Variant="outline" Size="lg" Href="https://github.com/krewire/krewire/releases" Target="_blank" DataI18n="hero.cta_releases_gh">GitHub Releases ↗</Button>
        </div>
        <div class="meta" data-i18n="hero.meta">Go 1.27.1+ · Single Monorepo · 8 Unified Workloads · Spec-Driven Testing</div>
      </div>
      <div class="hero-art">
        <div class="code-terminal-card">
          <div class="code-terminal-bar">
            <div class="terminal-dots">
              <span class="term-dot red"></span>
              <span class="term-dot yellow"></span>
              <span class="term-dot green"></span>
            </div>
            <span class="term-title">kiw — release v0.1.0 (GA)</span>
          </div>
          <div class="code-terminal-body">
            <div class="term-line"><span class="term-prompt">$</span> <span class="term-cmd">go install github.com/krewire/krewire/tools/kiw/cmd/kiw@latest</span></div>
            <div class="term-line term-info">✓ installed kiw devtool v0.1.0 (go1.27.1 linux/amd64)</div>
            <div class="term-line"><span class="term-prompt">$</span> <span class="term-cmd">kiw new my-service --kind=app</span></div>
            <div class="term-line term-info">✓ scaffolded workload app behind krewire.yaml</div>
            <div class="term-line"><span class="term-prompt">$</span> <span class="term-cmd">cd my-service &amp;&amp; kiw dev</span></div>
            <div class="term-line term-success">⚡ [krewire] server live at http://localhost:8080 (0.4ms)</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

